#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Press the New button, select New from the Game menu or press <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I redirect ships once they've left a planet?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "No, once ships leave a planet, they can not be stopped or redirected."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do the different colors and shapes of planets mean anything?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "No, they are random."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I know where my ships are?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click <guibutton>Show Standings</guibutton>. It will give you information "
"about fleets currently in flight."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "I've lost all my planets, but I'm still in the game, why?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "You haven't lost the game until you have lost all your ships."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "I'm running out of turns, what can I do?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can continue playing. When you're at the last turn, you will be promted "
"to add more."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I store ships on a planet for later use?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, you should however store them on multiple planets to be able to send "
"them to nearby planets."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have sent out all the ships on a planet, but when I move my mouse over the "
"planet, it shows the ships still in place, why?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid "The number of ships on a planet is updated when a turn is ended."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is it possible to change the theme?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "No, that is not possible at the moment."
msgstr ""

